@wx0165927473 

It turns out that the openai provider name cannot be overwritten. It works fine when I change the name to openai-custom.

```
// it is work!
"openai-custom": {
      "options": {
        "reasoningEffort": "medium",
        "reasoningSummary": "auto",
        "textVerbosity": "medium",
        "include": [
          "reasoning.encrypted_content"
        ],
        "store": false
      },
```

